[[48,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><strong>- 1072B42 left hand or right hand inlet manifold (one) - r+r</strong></p><p><a href=\"#/3237538\">1056B62</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the relevant inlet manifold (1b).</p><p>Remove the gasket.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013587.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[48,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the inlet manifold complete with a\nnew gasket and fix it tightening the bolts to the specified torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>INLET MANIFOLD</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.9 - 2.3</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/3237538\">1056B62</a></p><p><strong>- 1072B42 left hand or right hand inlet manifold (one) - r+r</strong></p>"]]